WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.918
(knocks on door)

00:00:01.919 --> 00:00:04.421
-Wanted to see me sir?
-Sit down, Kurt.

00:00:04.421 --> 00:00:06.340
Thank you, coach.
I prefer to stand.

00:00:07.257 --> 00:00:09.384
Alright. Go ahead then.

00:00:09.384 --> 00:00:10.636
Tell me.

00:00:11.637 --> 00:00:12.971
Tell you what?

00:00:13.597 --> 00:00:15.432
Why a team worth $800 million,

00:00:15.432 --> 00:00:17.601
one of the most complex
offenses ever built,

00:00:18.602 --> 00:00:21.146
should put you in
the driver's seat?

00:00:21.146 --> 00:00:23.690
You're too old to be a rookie,
too green to be a pro.

00:00:24.316 --> 00:00:27.277
So why in the world would
I give you this shot?

00:00:29.446 --> 00:00:32.699
(inspirational music)

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:38.830
All my life, I defined
myself through sports.

00:00:40.374 --> 00:00:42.501
I've always come up empty.

00:00:42.501 --> 00:00:44.127
Coach, I can win for you.

00:00:44.127 --> 00:00:46.880
You need to start thinking
about life after football, son.

00:00:48.924 --> 00:00:51.343
We gave you the chance.

00:00:51.343 --> 00:00:52.678
We're letting you go.

00:00:54.179 --> 00:00:57.891
I was meant for
something. Something more.

00:00:57.891 --> 00:00:59.184
You think
you can be that guy?

00:00:59.184 --> 00:01:00.978
Yeah, I do

00:01:00.978 --> 00:01:02.354
What are you doing here?

00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:06.775
I wasn't ready for
it, but I am now.

00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:11.363
You defied all odds.

00:01:12.656 --> 00:01:14.324
I waited for it.

00:01:14.324 --> 00:01:15.659
I bled for it.

00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:19.454
I know who I am.

00:01:20.622 --> 00:01:22.040
And I know why I'm here.

00:01:23.875 --> 00:01:25.127
If you give me a chance,

00:01:25.127 --> 00:01:28.088
[Commentator] Green went down
hard and is not getting up.

00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:30.007
I will not let you down.

00:01:36.054 --> 00:01:37.931
You were born for this.

00:01:39.891 --> 00:01:42.519
Something special
about you, son.

00:01:44.146 --> 00:01:46.189
Destiny

00:01:46.189 --> 00:01:48.275
belongs to the underdogs.

00:01:50.694 --> 00:01:52.195
You want to prove that?

